  "description": "Instructional illustration of the refuted supposition that a meets plane alpha at N. This is a conditional proof diagram, not a realizable space model asserting the contradictory conjunction of parallel a/b, external M and an actual a/alpha intersection. Assertions cover projected marks, stroke incidence and patch placement only; no assertion of spatial parallelism or skewness is made. Plane width/height and projected stroke directions are layout choices, not metric givens.",
  "source": {
    "image": {"path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-18.png", "sha256": "abda4d00e1a5bcd52763ac63a14a20c3fda3148d7a63db5b04ab6d3ed31b9a3e"},
    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "假设 $a$ 与 $\\alpha$ 有公共点 $N$（图18）。\n直线 $a$ 与 $b$ 平行且不重合，因此直线 $b$ 不经过直线 $a$ 上的点 $N$。\n根据异面直线的判定（§ 6），直线 $a$ 与 $b$ 是异面直线。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "图 17"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "图 18"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "这就产生了矛盾：直线 $a$ 与 $b$ 既异面，又平行。\n因此，直线 $a$ 与平面 $\\alpha$ 不可能有公共点。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n7", "text": "因此，只有以下三种可能的情形：\n1) $a\\subset\\alpha$；\n2) $a\\cap\\alpha=A$；\n\n3) $a\\cap\\alpha=\\varnothing$。\n与研究两条直线的位置关系时一样，把第一种和第三种情形合并为一种情形。"}
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {"id": "f18-plane-patch", "description": "One full wide plane panel from the rejected-assumption diagram; finite patch limits are not spatial boundaries.", "objects": ["f18-plane"], "assertions": ["f18-plane-count"]},
      {"id": "f18-plane-name", "description": "Alpha inside the left/lower plane patch.", "objects": ["f18-alpha-label", "f18-plane"], "assertions": ["f18-alpha-label-inside", "f18-label-count"]},
      {"id": "f18-line-a", "description": "Full a stroke starts outside the patch and enters toward N; this visual entry represents a supposition, not a true space intersection.", "objects": ["f18-a", "f18-a-label"], "assertions": ["f18-a-endpoints", "f18-label-count"]},
      {"id": "f18-point-pair", "description": "Two source marks M,N on a, with M shown above the patch and N in it. Only projected collinearity/incidence is asserted; no contradictory spatial conjunction.", "objects": ["f18-M", "f18-N", "f18-a", "f18-M-label", "f18-N-label"], "assertions": ["f18-M-N-stroke-incidence", "f18-N-inside-patch", "f18-point-count", "f18-label-count"], "requires": ["pointRelationships"]},
      {"id": "f18-line-b", "description": "Separate short solid b inside the left/middle patch; no N incidence and no asserted real spatial parallel/skew conjunction.", "objects": ["f18-b", "f18-b-label", "f18-plane"], "assertions": ["f18-b-endpoints", "f18-b-first-inside", "f18-b-last-inside", "f18-b-label-inside"]},
      {"id": "f18-boundaries", "description": "All four plane boundaries, a/b spans, two marks and five source labels, with no caption, arrow or invented contradiction symbol.", "objects": ["f18-plane", "f18-a", "f18-b", "f18-M", "f18-N", "f18-M-label", "f18-N-label", "f18-alpha-label", "f18-a-label", "f18-b-label"], "assertions": ["f18-plane-count", "f18-line-count", "f18-point-count", "f18-label-count"]}
